'''Draugr Elite''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in the [[Swamp|Swamps]].  They are ancient undead Vikings that have since become bloated in appearance. They are stronger than normal [[Draugr]], but always appear equipped with a melee weapon. They have glowing purple eyes and are relatively rare compared to their weaker counterparts.

