== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Draugr elite|Aggressive creature strategies#Draugr elite}}

=== Sword ===
Does a horizontal slash that extends 2.2 meters and arcs 90 degrees (58 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack has a 4-second cooldown and can be used within 1.6 meters of a player.

